Subject: [PATCH] upscalers: Use OptiScaler nightly's bundled dependencies.

Avoid downloading standalone XeSS and FidelityFX libraries solely for a
nightly. Follow the installed channel for offline fallback and retain
explicit standalone upgrades and shared DLSS libraries.

Migrate only checksum-matching installer-owned duplicates with validated
bundled replacements. Preserve custom paths and user files, and roll back
removal if tracking cannot be saved. Cover selection and migration in tests.

---
